        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>函数的性质</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    min-height: 100%;\n    background: #087bb7;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 17px;\n    color: #111;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 506px;\n    min-width: 506px;\n    height: 684px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    padding: 21px 37px 24px;\n    background: #fff;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.62;\n  }\n\n  .summary-table {\n    width: 382px;\n    height: 230px;\n    margin: 0;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    line-height: 1.38;\n  }\n\n  .summary-table col:nth-child(1) { width: 51px; }\n  .summary-table col:nth-child(2) { width: 113px; }\n  .summary-table col:nth-child(3) { width: 127px; }\n  .summary-table col:nth-child(4) { width: 91px; }\n\n  .summary-table th,\n  .summary-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 2px 5px;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n\n  .summary-table thead th {\n    height: 29px;\n    padding: 3px 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  .summary-table .property {\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  .summary-table .definition {\n    padding: 2px 5px;\n  }\n\n  .summary-table .method {\n    padding: 1px 5px;\n    line-height: 1.38;\n  }\n\n  .em-red {\n    color: #e11c1c;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .graph-cell {\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    vertical-align: middle !important;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .small-graph {\n    width: 125px;\n    height: 95px;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder-caption {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 1px;\n    height: 1px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  svg {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .notes {\n    width: 382px;\n    margin: 1px 0 0 18px;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n\n  .notes p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .red-note {\n    color: #de1717;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .composition {\n    margin-top: 5px !important;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n\n  .composition-line {\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .section {\n    width: 432px;\n    margin-top: 9px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n\n  .section-title {\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n  }\n\n  .check {\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .two-zone {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 292px 132px;\n    column-gap: 8px;\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n\n  .property-text p {\n    margin: 0 0 6px 21px;\n  }\n\n  .large-graph {\n    width: 132px;\n    height: 184px;\n    margin-top: -2px;\n  }\n\n  .definition-section {\n    width: 432px;\n    margin-top: -7px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n  }\n\n  .definition-section .heading {\n    margin: 0 0 1px;\n  }\n\n  .definition-section p {\n    margin: 0 0 4px 18px;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n\n  .definition-section .continuation {\n    margin-left: 29px;\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 1px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #3986a8;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n\n  mjx-container {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <table class=\"summary-table\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col><col><col><col>\n    </colgroup>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>函数的<br>性质</th>\n        <th>定义</th>\n        <th>图像</th>\n        <th>判定方法</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"property\" rowspan=\"2\">函数的<br>单调性</td>\n        <td class=\"definition\">\n          如果对于属于定义域 I 内某个区间上的任意两个自变量的值\n          $x_1$、$x_2$，当 $x_1&lt;x_2$ 时，都有\n          <span class=\"em-red\">$f(x_1)&lt;f(x_2)$</span>，那么就说\n          $f(x)$ 在这个区间上是<span class=\"em-red\">增函数</span>。\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"graph-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder small-graph\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[函数递增图像]</span>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 125 95\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <line x1=\"14\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"113\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n              <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"87\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n              <path d=\"M112 78 l-4 -2 l0 4 z\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n              <path d=\"M18 9 l-2 4 l4 0 z\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n              <path d=\"M26 66 C40 60,45 51,53 42 C63 31,73 31,84 18\"\n                    fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d74747\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <line x1=\"47\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"47\" y2=\"57\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n              <line x1=\"85\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"85\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n              <text x=\"5\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"7\">0</text>\n              <text x=\"114\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"8\">x</text>\n              <text x=\"8\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"8\">y</text>\n              <text x=\"42\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"7\">x₁</text>\n              <text x=\"82\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"7\">x₂</text>\n              <text x=\"60\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#e02020\" font-size=\"9\">y=f(x)</text>\n              <text x=\"31\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"7\">f(x₁)</text>\n              <text x=\"87\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"7\">f(x₂)</text>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"method\">\n          （1）利用定义<br>\n          （2）利用已知函数的单调性<br>\n          （3）利用函数图象（在某个区间图象上升为增）<br>\n          （4）利用复合函数\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"definition\">\n          如果对于属于定义域 I 内某个区间上的任意两个自变量的值\n          $x_1$、$x_2$，当 $x_1&lt;x_2$ 时，都有\n          <span class=\"em-red\">$f(x_1)&gt;f(x_2)$</span>，那么就说\n          $f(x)$ 在这个区间上是<span class=\"em-red\">减函数</span>。\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"graph-cell\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder small-graph\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[函数递减图像]</span>\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 125 95\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <line x1=\"14\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"113\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n              <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"87\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n              <path d=\"M112 78 l-4 -2 l0 4 z\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n              <path d=\"M18 9 l-2 4 l4 0 z\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n              <path d=\"M29 23 C42 29,50 40,61 48 C71 56,79 61,96 66\"\n                    fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d74747\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <line x1=\"47\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"47\" y2=\"31\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n              <line x1=\"85\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"85\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/>\n              <text x=\"5\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"7\">0</text>\n              <text x=\"114\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"8\">x</text>\n              <text x=\"8\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"8\">y</text>\n              <text x=\"43\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"7\">x₁</text>\n              <text x=\"82\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"7\">x₂</text>\n              <text x=\"61\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#e02020\" font-size=\"9\">y=f(x)</text>\n              <text x=\"27\" y=\"37\" font-size=\"7\">f(x₁)</text>\n              <text x=\"78\" y=\"59\" font-size=\"7\">f(x₂)</text>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"method\">\n          （1）利用定义<br>\n          （2）利用已知函数的单调性<br>\n          （3）利用函数图象（在某个区间图象下降为减）<br>\n          （4）利用复合函数\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <section class=\"notes\">\n    <p class=\"red-note\">\n      ②在公共定义域内，两个增函数的和是增函数，两个减函数的和是减函数，增函数减去<br>\n      一个减函数为增函数，减函数减去一个增函数为减函数。\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"composition\">\n      ③对于复合函数 $y=f[g(x)]$，令 $u=g(x)$，若 $y=f(u)$ 为增，$u=g(x)$ 为增，则\n      <span class=\"composition-line\">$y=f[g(x)]$为增；若 $y=f(u)$为减，$u=g(x)$为减，则 $y=f[g(x)]$为增；若 $y=f(u)$</span>\n      <span class=\"composition-line\">为增，$u=g(x)$为减，则 $y=f[g(x)]$为减；若 $y=f(u)$为减，$u=g(x)$为增，则</span>\n      <span class=\"composition-line\">$y=f[g(x)]$为减。</span>\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\">\n    <p class=\"section-title\">\n      （2）打“<span class=\"check\">√</span>”函数 $f(x)=x+\\dfrac{a}{x}\\;(a&gt;0)$ 的图象与性质\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"two-zone\">\n      <div class=\"property-text\">\n        <p>\n          $f(x)$ 分别在 $(-\\infty,-\\sqrt a]$、$[\\sqrt a,+\\infty)$ 上为增函数，分别\n          <strong>$f(x)=x+\\dfrac{a}{x}\\;(a&gt;0)$</strong>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          在 $[-\\sqrt a,0)$、$(0,\\sqrt a]$ 上为减函数。\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder large-graph\">\n        <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[函数图像：右侧]</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 132 184\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n          <line x1=\"47\" y1=\"177\" x2=\"47\" y2=\"7\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n          <path d=\"M125 92 l-5 -2.5 l0 5 z\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n          <path d=\"M47 6 l-2.5 5 l5 0 z\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n          <path d=\"M48 9 C49 29,51 51,57 61 C65 75,79 67,116 28\"\n                fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c94747\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <path d=\"M10 160 C24 148,37 138,42 126 C46 115,46.5 103,46.8 96\"\n                fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c94747\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <path d=\"M46.6 89 C46.1 79,45.4 58,42 38\"\n                fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c94747\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"35\" y2=\"82\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"59\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"59\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"35\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"47\" y2=\"82\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"47\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"59\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#777\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/>\n          <text x=\"126\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"7\">x</text>\n          <text x=\"39\" y=\"9\" font-size=\"7\">y</text>\n          <text x=\"25\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"7\">2√a</text>\n          <text x=\"20\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"7\">−√a</text>\n          <text x=\"52\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"7\">√a</text>\n          <text x=\"51\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"7\">−2√a</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"definition-section\">\n    <p class=\"heading\">（3）<span class=\"em-red\">最大（小）值定义</span></p>\n    <p>\n      ①一般地，设函数 $y=f(x)$ 的定义域为 $I$，如果存在实<br>\n      数 $M$ 满足：（1）对于任意的 $x\\in I$，都有 $f(x)\\leq M$；\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"continuation\">\n      （2）存在 $x_0\\in I$，使得 $f(x_0)=M$。那么，我们称 $M$<br>\n      是函数 $f(x)$ 的最大值，记作 $f_{\\max}(x)=M$；\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      ②一般地，设函数 $y=f(x)$ 的定义域为 $I$，如果存在实数 $m$ 满足：（1）对于任意的 $x\\in I$，<br>\n      都有 $f(x)\\geq m$；（2）存在 $x_0\\in I$，使得 $f(x_0)=m$。那么，我们称 $m$ 是函数 $f(x)$ 的最\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">第5页 共15页</footer>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
